# Trust: Ulmia (hidden quest TrustUlmia): a level 99 Warrior in Misareaux Coast. The Dilapidated Gate _0p0 (no script;
# default SNOWMINT_POINT_LOCKED). CoP past Dawn (The Last Verse) with Dawn's Status 2 (setup). No permit: the default
# message. The San d'Oria Trust Permit (a GM): 560 (0, 0, 0, memories 0); finished on 0: nothing. Apocalypse Nigh
# completed (a GM): memories 2; finished on 2: Ulmia learned, YOU_LEARNED_TRUST. Learned: the default message.
lists MisareauxCoast/_0p0/onTrigger MisareauxCoast/onEventFinish/560
char zone=MisareauxCoast pos=260,7.3,-438.5 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Cop TheLastVerse current
